{"date":"2026-09-20","action":"bootstrap-inspection","project":"ZHaiCode","repository":"https://github.com/LaurentFough/ZHaiCode.git","base_commit":"9753b85f18587a4d0a2ece180dc3abcf3b4390e0","details":"Empty local directory; cloned existing repository with README only. Created phase-0-1-bootstrap branch. Read original design task 6ab07655-babc-83e8-9a97-6ee4d9a21b03 and current handoff. No architecture changes or component renames."}
{"date":"2026-09-20","action":"implementation","version":"0.1.0","details":"Added seven JSON schemas/examples, required project documents, three ADRs, protocol/runbook/setup documentation; Python agentd/agent-watchd/agentctl skeletons; pure lease transitions; PostgreSQL migrations, row-locked fenced mutations, metadata registration and recovery reads; tests and Makefile. No stash, vector memory, automatic merge, tracked-file deletions or outside-project output paths introduced."}
{"date":"2026-09-20","action":"environment","details":"Python 3.14.7 virtual environment in .venv. Dependency caches, temporary files and retained test artifacts in .runtime. Recreate on another machine with make install (or requirements-dev.lock constraints); make check; set a dedicated ZHAICODE_TEST_DSN; make integration; make build. Database/Git secrets and local runtimes are ignored. Repository schemas and SQL ship in wheel."}
{"date":"2026-09-20","action":"verification-fixes","details":"Protocol tests caught missing optional JSON Schema date-time checker; added explicit rfc3339-validator runtime dependency. Ruff import formatting applied without renaming symbols or removing comments. Built wheel includes all seven schemas and SQL migration. Added CI for Python 3.11/3.14 and PostgreSQL 16. Added requirements-dev.lock with tested package versions."}
{"date":"2026-09-20","action":"postgres-test-runtime","details":"No PostgreSQL installed on host. Downloaded pgserver 0.1.4 wheel into .runtime and extracted only as a source of PostgreSQL 16.2 test binaries; no Python pgserver dependency or vector extension was installed/enabled. Initial sandboxed initdb failed shared-memory permission and automatically removed its newly created incomplete scratch cluster; no pre-existing or tracked project files were affected. Retried with --no-clean and host permission. Database files/log/socket remain project-local; TCP listening disabled. Sandbox socket access also required permission for integration tests."}
{"date":"2026-09-20","action":"verification-passed","details":"make release: Ruff passed; 29 unit/schema/CLI tests passed; 9 PostgreSQL integration tests passed; wheel and sdist built. Verified wheel contains seven schemas and SQL migration and can validate payloads from isolated wheel import. PostgreSQL 16.2, Python 3.14.7, macOS arm64. Tests retain unique data/records. Restored user-required #= comment formatting after formatter normalized spacing. Full Git-backed two-machine recovery, authenticated transport and watchdog supervision remain explicitly deferred in docs/MILESTONE.md."}
